Android's independent effect RNG consumes an extra sample in random-duration
guards (BlinkRandInit 00071f4c, AddSlug 0007953c, Twinkle::AI 0005cc38,
Slug::Explode 00077b08) and one angle per background star (0006aff8).
Slugs burst into 20 larger particles; basic shots have no trail and rockets
emit smoke every fourth tick (000629c0, 000635d4). Pick-up rings allocate,
update and release eight larger stars 45 degrees apart (0006fa10, 0006e8a0).

